Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:26:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 595/612] perf(moe,tilelang): compact 2-bit and 4-bit expert
 scale codes in one storage buffer

Pack each expert's compact code buffer unit offset and narrow flag into a single uint16 entry ((unit_base << 1) | is_narrow) via narrow_code_offsets so grouped_fp8_fp4_gemm computes code_base and Narrow_flag in O(1) before the TMA prologue instead of scanning Narrow[0..expert-1] per CTA.
